            "AI agents (MCP)": [
                "T\u00e1c nh\u00e2n AI (MCP)"
            ],
            "Let AI assistants such as Claude, Cursor or VS Code work on this site for you through MCP (Model Context Protocol). They sign in as a WordPress user (Claude and ChatGPT by approving them here, others with an application password) and can do only what that user is allowed to do.": [
                "Cho ph\u00e9p c\u00e1c tr\u1ee3 l\u00fd AI nh\u01b0 Claude, Cursor ho\u1eb7c VS Code l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c tr\u00ean trang web n\u00e0y cho b\u1ea1n th\u00f4ng qua MCP (Model Context Protocol). Ch\u00fang \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u1edbi t\u01b0 c\u00e1ch l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng WordPress (Claude v\u00e0 ChatGPT b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t t\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, c\u00e1c tr\u1ee3 l\u00fd kh\u00e1c b\u1eb1ng m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng) v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n nh\u1eefng g\u00ec ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p l\u00e0m."
            ],
            "AI agents need WordPress 6.9 or later. Update WordPress to use them.": [
                "C\u00e1c t\u00e1c nh\u00e2n AI y\u00eau c\u1ea7u WordPress 6.9 tr\u1edf l\u00ean. H\u00e3y c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt WordPress \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng."
            ],
            "Allow AI agents (MCP)": [
                "Cho ph\u00e9p t\u00e1c nh\u00e2n AI (MCP)"
            ],
            "Off: the tools below and their REST routes are not registered at all.": [
                "T\u1eaft: c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi v\u00e0 c\u00e1c tuy\u1ebfn REST c\u1ee7a ch\u00fang ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd."
