            "Claude and ChatGPT: sign in instead": [
                "Claude v\u00e0 ChatGPT: thay v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 h\u00e3y \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp"
            ],
            "Add the connection address as a custom connector in Claude, or as an app in ChatGPT developer mode. They open this site so you can approve them; no password to copy.": [
                "Th\u00eam \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng tr\u00ecnh k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i t\u00f9y ch\u1ec9nh trong Claude ho\u1eb7c d\u01b0\u1edbi d\u1ea1ng \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng trong ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 nh\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u1ee7a ChatGPT. H\u1ecd s\u1ebd m\u1edf trang web n\u00e0y \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t; kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n sao ch\u00e9p m\u1eadt kh\u1ea9u."
